# py/generated/ is intentionally NOT ignored. Its artifacts are the producer
# side of the cross-repo config contracts (skkuverse/contracts/manifest.json):
# consumers compare their vendored copies against what is committed here, and
# CI regenerates + `git diff --exit-code` to prove committed == SSOT-derived.
# See .gitattributes for review-diff collapsing.

# Logs
*.log
